## Check the implementation

Test the label, hint and error announced together. Check that the hint stays visible at increased text size and does not rely on colour or position. Use the [civica accessibility checks](../accessibility/testing.html), then compare light and dark modes, at least two theme colours, and 320 CSS pixels.

